What:		/sys/kernel/mm/numa_balancing/numa_scan_size_mb
Date:		July 2026
Contact:	Linux memory management mailing list <linux-mm@kvack.org>
Description:
		Read-write size, in megabytes, of the virtual address range
		processed by each normal automatic NUMA-balancing scan. The value
		must be non-zero. Writes require CAP_SYS_ADMIN.

