What:		/sys/kernel/mm/numa_balancing/local_fault_rate
Date:		May 2026
Contact:	Linux memory management mailing list <linux-mm@kvack.org>
Description:
		Read-write percentage controlling local-tier refault sampling.
		Zero disables the local sampler. Values from 1 through 100 select
		base-page PFNs at the requested rate.

		The local sampler can run while kernel.numa_balancing is zero.
		It installs NUMA protection probes but does not enable migration.

