Date:		May 2026
Contact:	Linux memory management mailing list <linux-mm@kvack.org>
Description:
		Read-write local-tier sampling period in milliseconds. The value
		must be non-zero.

What:		/sys/kernel/mm/numa_balancing/local_fault_scan_size_mb
Date:		May 2026
Contact:	Linux memory management mailing list <linux-mm@kvack.org>
Description:
